  "description": "<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <strong>Brand introduction</strong>: Reva is a trusted marketplace for curated, high-quality pet care, bringing together carefully selected brands that elevate the everyday lives of pets and their parents. We’re redefining pet care through thoughtful curation, transparency, and education.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <strong>Product description</strong>: Reva offers a thoughtfully curated range of pet products across four key pillars:</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>Nourish:</strong> Supplements, nutrition, and treats.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>Explore:</strong> Adventure gear, travel essentials, and outdoor must-haves.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>Restore:</strong> Personal care, grooming, and wellness products.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>Nest:</strong> Stylish and comfortable home products, including pet beds, furniture, and toys.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong>: Reva is a one-stop shop and lifestyle destination for modern pet parents, thoughtfully curating trusted, ethically sourced, and high-quality brands. We simplify pet wellness and elevate everyday life by providing expert-led content, advice, and stylish, practical solutions for pets and their owners.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <strong>Payment terms</strong>: Affiliates earn a 5% commission per sale, paid monthly via bank transfer or PayPal.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <strong>Other information</strong>: We’re passionate about collaborating closely with affiliates who share our values. Affiliates benefit from access to exclusive content, and tailored support to maximize conversion and build authentic engagement.</p>\n</div>",
